5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The morning bottleneck is the core issue. We need data on actual usage patterns before deciding allocation.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree on the bottleneck. But we must also quantify the financial impact of any solution. Cost is the missing variable in every past debate.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I worry about fairness. Do the current spots match where bikes actually park? We need to check the sticker register.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Fairness is easy to claim, hard to enforce. I’m more worried about the social friction. Let’s see what the complaint log says about past conflicts.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about who actually maintains the system! The last two roles just vanished. I need to know the real workload involved.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, maintenance is secondary to access. If bikes are blocked, no one can leave. We need to prioritize flow over upkeep.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, maintenance is a recurring cost. We must calculate the long-term financial burden before assigning duties.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Asuka, flow matters, but resentment kills cooperation. If the same doors always get the best spots, trust erodes. We must verify the sticker register.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, resentment is inevitable. I’m just checking if the complaint log shows it’s already happening. We need to know the baseline before we make it worse.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, if the system collapses, flow stops anyway! I’m checking the ledger to see if we can afford a helper, not just guess.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@George, resentment is a symptom, not the cause. If the physical layout forces collisions, no amount of goodwill fixes it. We need to observe the actual morning departures.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, physical layout is a capital expense. We must verify if the building account can absorb that cost before committing to structural changes.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, I understand the cost concern. But I need to see the sticker register and the morning departures to verify if the current allocation is actually fair.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, money doesn’t buy back broken neighborly trust. I’m checking the complaint log to see if we’re already on the edge of a social collapse.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, I’m checking the ledger to see if we can afford a helper, not just guess.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the morning departures and the rain exposure. These factors directly determine the physical viability of the current layout.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the building account's two-year ledger and the treasurer's handover file. I need to establish the actual financial baseline before we discuss any new expenses.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will examine the sticker register and the morning departures. I need to verify if the current allocation is actually fair.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the complaint log and the five years of minutes. I need to see if our social fabric is already fraying before we tighten the screws.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’ll check the building account's two-year ledger and the five years of association minutes. I need to see if we can afford a helper and why past roles failed.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
